10" style="display:none"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <hr /> <h3><span>此处可与上述改变logo的代码并放。</span></h3> <hr /></div> <div class="help"> <blockquote> <p>include组件代码块的起始，<strong>需完整地黏贴在开头</strong> ↦</p> <p>可不填。填true时启用自定义页眉标题 ↦</p> <p>大标题文本 ↦</p> <p>次标题文本 ↦</p> <p>大标题字体 ↦</p> <p>次标题字体 ↦</p> <p>结束引用块 ↦</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include&#32;:scp-wiki-cn:theme:broken-world</span></p> <p>|my-title=true</p> <p>|header-title=</p> <p>|header-subtitle=</p> <p>|header-title-font=</p> <p>|header-subtitle-font=</p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">]]</span></p> </blockquote> </div> <br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> <blockquote> <p>这是一个引用块，在一行字的起始处加上“&gt; ”来创建。<br /> 更多文字</p> <hr /> <p>一条分割线</p> <blockquote> <p>嵌套引用块<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-774199-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup></p> </blockquote> </blockquote> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th>这是</th> <th>表格</th> </tr> <tr> <td>你应该老早</td> <td>就知道怎么</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="2">做这个了吧</td> </tr> </table> <hr /> <p><br /></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;你可能需要些字体</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;这里有：</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="code"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[module&#32;CSS]]</span><br /> @import url(<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/theme:broken-world/code/2">http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/theme:broken-world/code/2</a>);<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[/module]]</span></p> </div> <hr /> <h2><span>注意：若设备上未安装相应的中文字体时，才会显示英文字体</span></h2> <hr /> <div style="font-size: 150%;"> <p>正文字体为 思源宋体 <span style="font-family:'Merriweather';">/ Merriweather</span> 。<br /> <span style="font-family: var(--header-font);">页眉字体为